            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.55</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>New video models.</b> Happy Horse 1.1 (text, image and reference to video) and Veo 3.1, both with audio and up to 4K.</li>
<li><b>New image models.</b> Ideogram V3 for typography and graphic design, plus Ideogram V3 Reframe to extend an image into a new format.</li>
<li><b>Background removal for video.</b> Two new Enhancer tools: remove the background from a clip, or clean up green screen spill.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
